  (title_block
    (title "Matrix carrier (hardware/boards/matrix-carrier)")
    (date "2026-10-03")
    (rev "A")
    (company "Woody")
    (comment 1 "SOURCE for this board - edit in KiCad 9. board-netlist.yaml is exported from it: python3 tools/kicad.py export hardware/boards/matrix-carrier")
    (comment 2 "The Matrix on two 1x10 headers, hung from the oak top; J1 (J-MCU-C) is the Matrix ribbon's carrier end, straight above J-MCU (ADR 0021 amendment 2026-10-03)")
    (comment 3 "Nets carry the carrier sheet's names (hardware/carrier/netlist.yaml); tools/kicad.py check holds every pin to that sheet")
    (comment 4 "The three hanging mounts are board-only holes (layout.yaml mounts:), on PWR_GND")
